<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="The Other Side of Paradise"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Glass Animals"/><amll:meta key="album" value="How to Be a Human Being"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1440840442"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Dave Bayley</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">那时我还年少懵懂</text><text for="L2">心爱之人远走高飞 去追逐万人瞩目的巨星梦</text><text for="L3">他对我说 莫要牵挂</text><text for="L4">嘴角浮起胸有成竹的笑意 许诺得如此笃定</text><text for="L5">他买下一张单程车票</text><text for="L6">一路向西 去往成就凡人梦想的黄金之乡</text><text for="L7">从前六个孩子挤在阴暗狭窄的单间</text><text for="L8">一跃跌入阳光漫洒的池畔奢靡</text><text for="L9">他结识了一位身着范思哲华服的女子</text><text for="L10">披着粉色羽毛华裘 戴着硕大夸张的珠宝</text><text for="L11">誓要成为篮坛之上的旷世传奇</text><text for="L12">他要化身横扫赛场的奥拉朱旺</text><text for="L13">他开上了一辆金光璀璨的科迈罗</text><text for="L14">隔着公用电话那头向我炫耀</text><text for="L15">我极力克制心绪 保持平静</text><text for="L16">可我眼前的世界却仿佛坠入慢镜回放</text><text for="L17">再见了 我忧郁的爱人</text><text for="L18">多希望你能看清那深藏的残忍真相</text><text for="L19">沉沦于盲目的狂热 正在将你吞噬殆尽</text><text for="L20">朝着你迎头撞入的灼灼烈日绝望嘶吼</text><text for="L21">忆往昔我们相依为命 紧紧蜷缩在彼此怀里</text><text for="L22">如今你指节紧攥成拳 仿佛随时准备落荒而逃</text><text for="L23">最终我只能守着一个形同陌路的游魂</text><text for="L24">曾经苦苦执守的至乐天堂</text><text for="L25">换来的却唯有一缕冰冷虚影</text><text for="L26">在我生长的故乡新奥尔良</text><text for="L27">从未有人背井离乡去当耀眼的巨星</text><text for="L28">男人自当留守故里 珍视身边的挚爱</text><text for="L29">倾其所有呵护初降人世的骨肉</text><text for="L30">我仍旧想念着他 谁又能忍心责怪</text><text for="L31">那个少年早已变得彻底癫狂</text><text for="L32">深陷于聚光灯与镜头的贪婪迷欲 他正</text><text for="L33">追逐那纸醉金迷的虚妄黄粱梦</text><text for="L34">我深知你早已不在意 可我</text><text for="L35">我明知你已不再眷恋 却依旧徒劳挽留</text><text for="L36">我狂暴的怒雷将他击溃</text><text for="L37">漫天惊雷倾泻而下 彻底将他摧毁</text><text for="L38">那个珠光宝气的女子早已离去 可我</text><text for="L39">那女人早已弃他而去 唯有我依然在苦苦挣扎</text><text for="L40">想必一切终于迎来了终局</text><text for="L41">子弹穿膛而过 或许只是我的幻觉</text><text for="L42">身心彻骨麻木 毫无知觉</text><text for="L43">剧烈痛楚直冲头颅 意识一片冰冷麻木</text><text for="L44">我的躯体透出可怖的异样</text><text for="L45">这具残躯渐渐变了模样</text><text for="L46">我的身躯已然支离破碎</text><text for="L47">别了 我忧郁的爱人</text><text for="L48">多愿你能看穿这冰冷丑恶的世相</text><text for="L49">狂奔在欲望的漩涡里 终究送了性命</text><text for="L50">对着将你燃尽的烈阳发出绝望哀鸣</text><text for="L51">回想从前我们彼此相拥 依偎在纯粹的往昔</text><text for="L52">如今拳头死死攥紧 犹如亡命天涯</text><text for="L53">我终究只换来一缕素不相识的幽魂</text><text for="L54">曾经拼命紧抓的极乐梦境</text><text for="L55">最终只剩下一抹虚无的残影</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:35.954"><div begin="0:31.145" end="4:35.954"><p begin="0:31.145" end="0:33.884" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.145" end="0:31.544">When</span> <span begin="0:31.544" end="0:31.810">I</span> <span begin="0:31.810" end="0:32.093">was</span> <span begin="0:32.093" end="0:32.613">young</span> <span begin="0:32.613" end="0:32.981">and</span> <span begin="0:32.981" end="0:33.884">stupid</span></p><p begin="0:33.894" end="0:39.093" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.894" end="0:34.388">My</span> <span begin="0:34.388" end="0:34.893">love</span> <span begin="0:34.893" end="0:35.509">left</span> <span begin="0:35.509" end="0:35.741">to</span> <span begin="0:35.741" end="0:36.274">be</span> <span begin="0:36.274" end="0:36.733">a</span> <span begin="0:36.733" end="0:37.191">rock</span> <span begin="0:37.191" end="0:37.658">and</span> <span begin="0:37.658" end="0:38.141">roll</span> <span begin="0:38.141" end="0:39.093">star</span></p><p begin="0:39.143" end="0:42.314" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.143" end="0:39.589">He</span> <span begin="0:39.589" end="0:40.005">told</span> <span begin="0:40.005" end="0:40.437">me,</span> <span begin="0:40.437" end="0:40.922">"Please</span> <span begin="0:40.922" end="0:41.397">don't</span> <span begin="0:41.397" end="0:42.314">worry"</span></p><p begin="0:42.314" end="0:46.367" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.314" end="0:42.909">Wise</span> <span begin="0:42.909" end="0:43.277">little</span> <span begin="0:43.277" end="0:43.728">smile</span> <span begin="0:43.728" end="0:44.167">that</span> <span begin="0:44.167" end="0:44.634">spoke</span> <span begin="0:44.634" end="0:45.167">so</span> <span begin="0:45.167" end="0:46.367">safely</span></p><p begin="0:46.605" end="0:50.129" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.605" end="0:47.131">He</span> <span begin="0:47.131" end="0:47.684">booked</span> <span begin="0:47.684" end="0:47.934">a</span> <span begin="0:47.934" end="0:48.468">one-</span><span begin="0:48.468" end="0:48.918">way</span> <span begin="0:48.918" end="0:50.129">ticket</span></p><p begin="0:50.349" end="0:53.893" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.349" end="0:50.844">Out</span> <span begin="0:50.844" end="0:51.295">west,</span> <span begin="0:51.295" end="0:51.730">that's</span> <span begin="0:51.730" end="0:52.178">where</span> <span begin="0:52.178" end="0:52.644">they</span> <span begin="0:52.644" end="0:53.095">make</span> <span begin="0:53.095" end="0:53.893">it</span></p><p begin="0:54.074" end="0:57.763" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.074" end="0:54.523">Six</span> <span begin="0:54.523" end="0:55.006">kids</span> <span begin="0:55.006" end="0:55.489">stuck</span> <span begin="0:55.489" end="0:55.974">in</span> <span begin="0:55.974" end="0:56.390">a</span> <span begin="0:56.390" end="0:57.763">bedsit</span></p><p begin="0:57.763" end="1:02.341" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.763" end="0:58.267">To</span> <span begin="0:58.267" end="0:59.283">sunswept</span> <span begin="0:59.283" en