span> <span begin="1:28.723" end="1:29.640">over</span> <span begin="1:29.640" end="1:30.107">the</span> <span begin="1:30.107" end="1:31.455">payphone</span></p><p begin="1:31.622" end="1:35.206" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.622" end="1:32.053">I</span> <span begin="1:32.053" end="1:32.487">try</span> <span begin="1:32.487" end="1:32.919">to</span> <span begin="1:32.919" end="1:33.386">keep</span> <span begin="1:33.386" end="1:33.871">my</span> <span begin="1:33.871" end="1:34.354">cool,</span> <span begin="1:34.354" end="1:35.206">but</span></p><p begin="1:35.354" end="1:38.589" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.354" end="1:35.862">My</span> <span begin="1:35.862" end="1:36.230">life</span> <span begin="1:36.230" end="1:36.689">turns</span> <span begin="1:36.689" end="1:37.148">in</span> <span begin="1:37.148" end="1:37.630">slow</span> <span begin="1:37.630" end="1:38.589">motion</span></p><p begin="1:38.589" end="1:41.490" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.589" end="1:39.094">Bye-</span><span begin="1:39.094" end="1:39.584">bye,</span> <span begin="1:39.584" end="1:40.267">baby</span> <span begin="1:40.267" end="1:41.490">blue</span></p><p begin="1:41.490" end="1:45.188" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.490" end="1:41.739">I</span> <span begin="1:41.739" end="1:41.937">wish</span> <span begin="1:41.937" end="1:42.137">you</span> <span begin="1:42.137" end="1:42.387">could</span> <span begin="1:42.387" end="1:42.771">see</span> <span begin="1:42.771" end="1:43.238">the</span> <span begin="1:43.238" end="1:43.913">wicked</span> <span begin="1:43.913" end="1:45.188">truth</span></p><p begin="1:45.188" end="1:48.722" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.188" end="1:45.407">Caught</span> <span begin="1:45.407" end="1:45.623">up</span> <span begin="1:45.623" end="1:45.810">in</span> <span begin="1:45.810" end="1:46.074">a</span> <span begin="1:46.074" end="1:46.576">rush,</span> <span begin="1:46.576" end="1:47.008">it's</span> <span begin="1:47.008" end="1:47.741">killing</span> <span begin="1:47.741" end="1:48.722">you</span></p><p begin="1:48.882" end="1:52.352" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.882" end="1:49.427">Screaming</span> <span begin="1:49.427" end="1:49.614">at</span> <span begin="1:49.614" end="1:49.843">the</span> <span begin="1:49.843" end="1:50.325">sun</span> <span begin="1:50.325" end="1:50.757">you</span> <span begin="1:50.757" end="1:51.090">blow</span> <span begin="1:51.090" end="1:52.352">into</span></p><p begin="1:52.572" end="1:56.457" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.572" end="1:52.889">Curled</span> <span begin="1:52.889" end="1:53.089">up</span> <span begin="1:53.089" end="1:53.289">in</span> <span begin="1:53.289" end="1:53.556">a</span> <span begin="1:53.556" end="1:54.070">grip</span> <span begin="1:54.070" end="1:54.502">when</span> <span begin="1:54.502" end="1:54.753">we</span> <span begin="1:54.753" end="1:55.235">were</span> <span begin="1:55.235" end="1:56.457">us</span></p><p begin="1:56.457" end="1:59.840" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.457" end="1:57.008">Fingers</span> <span begin="1:57.008" end="1:57.178">in</span> <span begin="1:57.178" end="1:57.376">a</span> <span begin="1:57.376" end="1:57.792">fist</span> <span begin="1:57.792" end="1:58.258">like</span> <span begin="1:58.258" end="1:58.509">you</span> <span begin="1:58.509" end="1:58.933">might</span> <span begin="1:58.933" end="1:59.840">run</span></p><p begin="1:59.960" end="2:03.763" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.960" end="2:00.221">I</span> <span begin="2:00.221" end="2:00.621">settle</span> <span begin="2:00.621" end="2:00.839">for</span> <span begin="2:00.839" end="2:01.071">a</span> <span begin="2:01.071" end="2:01.573">ghost</span> <span begin="2:01.573" end="2:02.085">I</span> <span begin="2:02.085" end="2:02.736">never</span> <span begin="2:02.736" end="2:03.763">knew<